Public pretrained checkpoints
-----------------------------
The five public checkpoints used for the reproduction experiments
(cifar10_resnet20, cifar10_resnet32, cifar10_resnet56, cifar10_vgg16_bn,
cifar10_mobilenetv2_x1_0) are published by:

    chenyaofo/pytorch-cifar-models
    https://github.com/chenyaofo/pytorch-cifar-models
    Licensed under BSD 3-Clause

They are NOT redistributed in this repository; they are downloaded at run time
through torch.hub.  The model architectures implemented in se_resnet.py follow
the descriptions of:

  * He K, Zhang X, Ren S, et al. Deep residual learning for image recognition. CVPR 2016.
  * Hu J, Shen L, Sun G. Squeeze-and-excitation networks. CVPR 2018.

The implementation itself is original and is released under the MIT License
(see LICENSE).

